Package: ddcui-rs
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ddcutil, libc6 (>= 2.34), libfontconfig1, libwayland-client0, libwayland-cursor0, libxkbcommon0, libx11-6, libvulkan1
Maintainer: jerinshop7-maker <jerinshop7-maker@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Rust + GPUI monitor control via DDC/CI
 ddcui-rs is a Rust/GPUI reimplementation of ddcui. It reads and changes
 external monitor settings (brightness, contrast, ...) over DDC/CI by driving
 the ddcutil program.
Homepage: https://github.com/jerinshop7-maker/ddcui-rs
